This is a normal paragraph with no errors.

= Another Good Heading

Now let's test some errors:

== Unclosed Bold

This has *unclosed bold text that goes on forever

= Unclosed Italic

This has _unclosed italic that never closes

== Unclosed Code

This has `unclosed code span

= Multiple Unclosed

This has *bold and _italic and `code all unclosed

== Expression Errors

Simple math: #(1 + 2) works fine

Missing closing paren: #(5 + 3

Unexpected token: #(1 + )

Just garbage: #(+++---)

Missing opening paren: #5 + 3)

Empty expression: #()

== Nested Formatting Errors

This is *bold with _italic inside but italic unclosed

This is _italic with *bold inside* but italic unclosed

This is *bold with `code inside but code unclosed

== Complex Expression Errors

Unterminated in nested context: #(1 + (2 * 3)

Multiple operators: #(5 ++ 3)

Division by text: #(10 / hello)

== String Errors in Expressions

Bad string literal: #("unterminated string)

== Type Mismatch Errors (Lowerer)

Adding number to string: #(5 + "hello")

Subtracting strings: #("foo" - "bar")

Multiplying string by number: #("text" * 3)

Dividing string by number: #("hello" / 2)

Comparing incompatible types: #("text" > 5)

Boolean arithmetic: #(true + false)

Mixing everything: #(5 * "text" + true)

== Division by Zero (Not an Error - Returns inf)

This returns inf: #(10 / 0)

This returns -inf: #(-5 / 0)

This returns nan: #(0 / 0)

== More Type Errors

Less than with string: #("abc" < 10)

Greater or equal with mixed: #(5 >= "test")

Subtraction with bool: #(true - 5)

Multiplication with bool: #(false * 10)

== Mixed Errors

This paragraph has *unclosed bold and #(bad + expression and _unclosed italic

String type error: #("text" * 5)

= Heading with #(error + ) in it

Normal text after errors.

== Edge Cases

Empty bold: **

Empty italic: __

Empty code: ``

Just a hash: #

Hash without paren: #5

Hash with just paren: #(

== Cascading Errors

#(1 + #(2 * ) + 3)

*bold with #(bad expr + *

Type error in nested: #(5 + (10 * "text"))

== Valid After Errors

